# Durable working state for the parity program: the pinned upstream oracle
# checkout and freshly computed (not yet promoted) observations. Contents are
# regenerable — `python3 scripts/parity/ensure_oracle.py` restores the oracle —
# but this is NOT a cache and must not be swept under disk pressure. Promoted
# evidence lives in fixtures/parity/observations/ and IS tracked.
var/*
!var/README.md
